      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "The object system: the ObjectDef/ShapeDef registry, per-kind defs, text slots, outline geometry, and the object-preference registry. The shape contract — what a def is, text slots, outlines and anchors, color roles — is owned by design; this area records the layout of "
        },
        {
          "insert": "objects/",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " and the closed recipe for extending it."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
